<% content_for :body_class, "body--dark" %>

<section class="site-section--dark about-hero">
  <h1 class="site-section__title">About Casa Xolo</h1>
</section>

<section class="about-content">
  <div class="about-card">
    <h2 class="about-card__heading">Our Mission</h2>
    <p class="about-card__text">
      Casa Xolo Foundation is dedicated to rescuing and rehabilitating animals in need while celebrating
      our cultural heritage and strengthening community bonds. We believe that compassion for animals
      and care for our community go hand in hand.
    </p>

    <h2 class="about-card__heading">Our Vision</h2>
    <p class="about-card__text">
      We envision a world where every animal has a loving home, where cultural traditions are honored
      and preserved, and where communities come together to support one another. Our newly secured
      property will serve as a sanctuary for animals and a gathering place for our community.
    </p>

    <h2 class="about-card__heading">What We Do</h2>
    <ul class="about-card__list">
      <li>Rescue animals from dangerous or neglectful situations</li>
      <li>Provide medical care, rehabilitation, and foster homes</li>
      <li>Match animals with loving, permanent families</li>
      <li>Create community programs that celebrate our cultural heritage</li>
      <li>Build support networks and resources for pet owners</li>
    </ul>

    <hr class="about-card__divider">
    <h2 class="about-card__heading">Join Our Journey</h2>
    <p class="about-card__text">
      We're excited to announce that we've secured a property for our new facility! Now we need your
      help to transform this space into a haven for animals and a center for community connection.
      Every donation, volunteer hour, and foster home brings us closer to opening our doors.
    </p>

    <div class="about-card__actions">
      <%= link_to "Support Our Mission", "https://www.gofundme.com/f/support-bipocled-animal-rescue-efforts",
            class: "site-btn", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener noreferrer" %>
      <a href="#" class="site-btn site-btn--secondary">Get Involved</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
